spice
* SPICE Netlist
* Components:
* QP - PMOS
* QN - NMOS
* VCC, UBP, UBN - Voltage Sources
* RL - Load Resistor

* PMOS Transistor
* Drain Gate Source
M1 4 4 3 3 PMOS

* NMOS Transistor
* Drain Gate Source
M2 4 4 0 0 NMOS

* Voltage Sources
VCC 3 0 DC <value>
VBP 4 0 DC <value>
VBN 0 0 DC <value>

* Load Resistor
RL 2 0 <value>

* Global Parameters
.model PMOS PMOS
.model NMOS NMOS

.end